post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
xdg-desktop-portal-omarchy installed.

Each user on Omarchy / Hyprland should run once:

  xdg-desktop-portal-omarchy-setup

This copies the Quickshell plugin into ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/,
writes hyprland-portals.conf + xdph.conf, and restarts portal services.

Without Omarchy shell, dialogs fall back to the egui picker where available;
ScreenCast still uses xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland for capture.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
